PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_OakCongratulations::
    .string "OAK: Er-hem!\n"
    .string "Congratulations, {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "This floor is the POKéMON HALL OF\n"
    .string "FAME.\p"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPIONS are\n"
    .string "honored for their exploits here.\p"
    .string "Their POKéMON are also recorded in\n"
    .string "the HALL OF FAME.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "You have worked hard to become\n"
    .string "the new LEAGUE CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "Congratulations, {PLAYER}, you and\n"
    .string "your POKéMON are HALL OF FAMERS!$"


PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_JirachiAppears::
    .string "A soft golden light drifts into\n"
    .string "the HALL OF FAME.\p"
    .string "A small star-shaped POKéMON floats\n"
    .string "down and rests on your shoulder.\p"
    .string "It is JIRACHI, the wish POKéMON.\p"
    .string "It woke up for the first time in\n"
    .string "a thousand years, just for you.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_JirachiAsks::
    .string "Its third eye opens.\p"
    .string "The wish is yours to make.\p"
    .string "Whatever you choose, the world will\n"
    .string "remember it.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_EndingLetGo::
    .string "You shake your head, and smile.\p"
    .string "JIRACHI hums, light as a feather,\n"
    .string "and rises into the sky.\p"
    .string "Far away, the AURA settles. TEAM\n"
    .string "ONYBRIS falls silent.\p"
    .string "Your journey is not over.\n"
    .string "The road goes on.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_EndingNoBalls::
    .string "You wish that no POKéMON ever has\n"
    .string "to be kept in a POKé BALL again.\p"
    .string "Every BALL in the world cracks open\n"
    .string "at the same instant.\p"
    .string "Your partners look at you once,\n"
    .string "and choose to stay at your side.\p"
    .string "The wild ones do not. They melt\n"
    .string "into the grass and the waves, and\l"
    .string "never again answer a trainer.\p"
    .string "No more captures. A quiet world.\p"
    .string "Somewhere, the ECHOES OF TIME stay\n"
    .string "silent. Another wish might have\l"
    .string "woken them.\p"
    .string "THE END.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_EndingRuleAll::
    .string "You wish for every legendary POKéMON\n"
    .string "to answer to you alone.\p"
    .string "MEWTWO, the three birds, MEW and\n"
    .string "CELEBI all appear in your PC.\p"
    .string "The weather, the seas, the mountains\n"
    .string "obey your word now.\p"
    .string "Was this the right wish?\p"
    .string "Somewhere, the ECHOES OF TIME stay\n"
    .string "silent. Another wish might have\l"
    .string "woken them.\p"
    .string "THE END.$"
@ Topaze : explications des trois voeux (35 caracteres max par ligne)
PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_JirachiBossWish::
    .string "The ONYBRIS boss wanted this wish:\n"
    .string "free every POKéMON from humans,\l"
    .string "and end all POKé BALLS.\p"
    .string "Now the choice is yours.\n"
    .string "Each wish is explained first.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_Explain1::
    .string "LET IT GO:\n"
    .string "nothing changes in the world.\p"
    .string "You keep catching POKéMON freely.\p"
    .string "The AURA calms down and the\n"
    .string "ECHOES OF TIME open up.\p"
    .string "More to explore: the GRENALUX\n"
    .string "MINE, MEW, the legendary birds,\l"
    .string "and the COUNCIL of 20 veterans.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_Explain2::
    .string "NO MORE BALLS:\n"
    .string "the boss's wish comes true.\p"
    .string "You can NOT catch wild POKéMON\n"
    .string "anymore, except at the SAFARI.\p"
    .string "Your own POKéMON stay with you.\p"
    .string "In return: 6 partners from JOHTO\n"
    .string "and HOENN, 16 guard posts, each\l"
    .string "giving a rare POKéMON, and\l"
    .string "LUGIA, HO-OH and DEOXYS to earn.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_Explain3::
    .string "RULE THEM ALL:\n"
    .string "you get MEWTWO, the 3 birds, MEW\l"
    .string "and CELEBI right now.\p"
    .string "But everyone wants them back:\n"
    .string "about 25 duels await you, from\l"
    .string "the KANTO LEADERS up to STEVEN.\p"
    .string "The world stays as it is, and the\n"
    .string "ECHOES OF TIME stay shut.$"

PokemonLeague_HallOfFame_Text_ConfirmWish::
    .string "This choice is FINAL.\n"
    .string "Make this wish?$"
